And this week we started a conversation on spiritual disciplines.

458
00:34:09,920 --> 00:34:15,580
And we talked, because I'm a cranky old person and I act way older than I look, I was like, let's start with Sabbath.

459
00:34:15,580 --> 00:34:20,660
Let's talk about the Jewish practice of Sabbath that New Testament Christians completely ignore.

460
00:34:20,660 --> 00:34:21,700
And it'll be fun.

461
00:34:21,700 --> 00:34:24,580
And everybody was like, yay, Sabbath.

462
00:34:24,580 --> 00:34:28,660
Anyway, I thought that joke was going to be funnier than it was.

463
00:34:28,660 --> 00:34:29,180
It wasn't.

464
00:34:32,380 --> 00:34:41,300
