465
00:34:41,300 --> 00:34:43,980
And if he does, are we living it out?

466
00:34:43,980 --> 00:34:46,020
And we had this really intense discussion.

467
00:34:46,020 --> 00:34:56,020
And this person, this person in my small group said, two weeks ago when you said we were going to talk about Sabbath, I thought, I don't want to do that.

468
00:34:56,020 --> 00:34:57,580
This is a waste of time.

469
00:34:57,580 --> 00:35:00,100
It's an Old Testament command that doesn't apply to my life.

470
00:35:02,260 --> 00:35:08,120
And she said, and now I believe that it's a command that I've been disobeying.

471
00:35:08,120 --> 00:35:14,580
And me and my family are like, we're going to try and take steps to start applying this command that I believe we've been disobeying in our lives.

472
00:35:14,580 --> 00:35:15,720
I'm like, this, do you see this?

473
00:35:15,720 --> 00:35:16,360
This is a pattern.

474
00:35:16,360 --> 00:35:19,680
This is assess, agree, apply.

475
00:35:19,680 --> 00:35:22,240
Like, she's like, I sat under God's word.

476
00:35:22,240 --> 00:35:26,380
Like, I heard what he had to say about this thing that I've never thought about before.

477
00:35:27,220 --> 00:35:32,380
And I think he says something that doesn't really line up with how I've been living my life.

478
00:35:32,380 --> 00:35:34,000
And it's going to be hard.

479
00:35:34,000 --> 00:35:37,160
I've got kids and a schedule and life.

480
00:35:37,160 --> 00:35:45,300
But I think, I think, I think I believe that if I do what God says, it's actually going to be better for me than if I do what I want to do.

481
00:35:46,420 --> 00:35:55,180
And then let's take steps of practical obedience in the right direction.

482
00:35:55,180 --> 00:35:57,920
This, this is spiritual flourishing.

483
00:35:57,920 --> 00:36:01,420
See, morality would say, yeah, God says rest is important.

484
00:36:02,100 --> 00:36:08,220
And maybe I'll, like, maybe I'll delete my Instagram app for a couple of weeks because I spend too much time on it.

485
00:36:08,220 --> 00:36:10,640
Or, yeah, rest, God says rest is important.

486
00:36:10,640 --> 00:36:13,140
But I'm better at resting than that person is.

487
00:36:13,140 --> 00:36:14,340
And so I'm good.

488
00:36:14,340 --> 00:36:16,080
And we walk away from God's word.

489
00:36:16,080 --> 00:36:17,540
And we don't let it transform us.

490
00:36:17,540 --> 00:36:20,080
We don't let it tell us what's true about ourselves.

491
00:36:20,080 --> 00:36:24,860
And James is saying, don't, don't be deceived.

492
00:36:24,860 --> 00:36:30,440
Don't be deceived into moral living when you've been invited into spiritual flourishing.

493
00:36:30,440 --> 00:36:33,680
Allow the word of God to tell you what's true about your heart.

494
00:36:33,680 --> 00:36:36,120
And then tend to your heart.

495
00:36:36,120 --> 00:36:37,900
Because that's what God cares about.

496
00:36:37,900 --> 00:36:39,820
God cares about your heart, not your behavior.

497
00:36:39,820 --> 00:36:42,900
And when you address your heart, your behavior will change.

498
00:36:42,900 --> 00:36:48,860
When you allow God to begin to transform you from the inside out, that's when things get different.

499
00:36:48,860 --> 00:36:55,980
And at the, at the end of James' brother's famous teaching, the Sermon on the Mount,

500
00:36:55,980 --> 00:37:02,920
he gives an illustration that I think perfectly sums up everything that we've been talking about.

501
00:37:02,920 --> 00:37:08,100
What better thing to end with than the end of Jesus' most famous sermon?

502
00:37:08,100 --> 00:37:13,820
See, at the end of this sermon where he's hammering home the same point that James is hammering home,

503
00:37:13,820 --> 00:37:19,640
where he's saying, you've heard it said, behavior, but I say to you, heart condition.

504
00:37:20,340 --> 00:37:24,300
You've heard it said, behavior, but I say to you, heart condition.

505
00:37:24,300 --> 00:37:29,460
You've heard it said, outside matters more than inside, but I say to you, inside matters more than outside.

506
00:37:29,460 --> 00:37:34,760
Because when you address the inside, the outside will actually change, will have lasting change that matters.

507
00:37:34,760 --> 00:37:38,000
You've heard it said, it's what you build.

508
00:37:38,120 --> 00:37:41,100
But I say to you, it's what you build on.

509
00:37:41,100 --> 00:37:46,520
Jesus, at the end of his sermon, says,

510
00:37:46,520 --> 00:37:55,680
Everyone then who hears these words of mine and does them will be like a wise man who built his house on a rock.

511
00:37:55,680 --> 00:38:05,540
