512
00:38:06,880 --> 00:38:07,440
Why?

513
00:38:07,440 --> 00:38:10,600
Because it was founded on the rock.

514
00:38:10,600 --> 00:38:14,140
It was focused on the internal rather than the external.

515
00:38:14,140 --> 00:38:18,080
It was focused on heart transformation rather than behavior modification.

516
00:38:18,080 --> 00:38:26,260
But everyone who hears these words of mine and does not do them will be like a foolish man who built his house on the sand.

517
00:38:26,260 --> 00:38:32,800
And the rain fell, floods came, the winds blew and beat against this house, and it fell.

518
00:38:32,800 --> 00:38:36,120
And great was the fall of it.

519
00:38:37,760 --> 00:38:42,180
See, both those houses look pretty similar on the outside.

520
00:38:42,180 --> 00:38:45,080
Probably easier to build the one on the sand.

521
00:38:45,080 --> 00:38:45,900
It didn't take as long.

522
00:38:45,900 --> 00:38:47,260
It went up faster.

523
00:38:47,260 --> 00:38:52,560
Behavior modification is easier to do in a quicker way.

524
00:38:52,660 --> 00:38:56,960
But the spiritual transformation building our lives on the foundation that is Jesus.

525
00:38:56,960 --> 00:38:58,480
That's what we've been invited to.

526
00:38:58,480 --> 00:39:07,600
And that is a lifelong process that's done in relationship, and it's so much more freeing and life-giving than religious behavior modification.

527
00:39:08,600 --> 00:39:10,140
That's what you've been invited into.

528
00:39:10,140 --> 00:39:13,600
And so maybe you're here and you've never really given Jesus a chance.

529
00:39:13,600 --> 00:39:22,840
Or maybe you thought you were giving him a chance by just doing this behavior modification thing, by just trying to become a better person.

530
00:39:24,280 --> 00:39:26,080
I think James is saying, like, don't be deceived.

531
00:39:26,080 --> 00:39:33,500
Don't be deceived into believing that God cares about the external more than he cares about the internal.

532
00:39:33,500 --> 00:39:42,000
That, like, this word of truth, he wants to preach this message of truth over you, that Jesus has accomplished everything that we couldn't accomplish.

533
00:39:42,160 --> 00:39:45,300
And he wants you to receive that truth that becomes implanted into your hearts.

534
00:39:45,300 --> 00:39:49,720
And when it becomes implanted into your hearts, it leads to true freedom, to true life.

535
00:39:49,720 --> 00:39:52,220
That's the invitation of Jesus.

536
00:39:52,220 --> 00:39:53,420
Not become a better person.

537
00:39:53,420 --> 00:39:58,320
Follow the way of Jesus.

538
00:39:58,320 --> 00:40:02,840
Learn to allow him to transform you from the inside out.

539
00:40:02,840 --> 00:40:10,440
So if you're here and you've never considered the word of truth, the announcement of Jesus,

540
00:40:11,240 --> 00:40:12,440
there's an invitation there.

541
00:40:12,440 --> 00:40:17,080
