542
00:40:17,080 --> 00:40:17,720
We respond.

543
00:40:17,720 --> 00:40:18,880
I want to go that way.

544
00:40:18,880 --> 00:40:20,640
I want to try this thing out.

545
00:40:20,640 --> 00:40:22,360
I want to print this under the way of Jesus.

546
00:40:22,360 --> 00:40:23,280
I just encourage you, man.

547
00:40:23,280 --> 00:40:27,060
If that's you, I'd love to talk to you about that.

548
00:40:27,060 --> 00:40:31,180
I'd love to help you take steps into that process.

549
00:40:31,180 --> 00:40:35,000
Or maybe you're here and you've been churchgoer your whole life.

550
00:40:35,000 --> 00:40:36,360
You've been a follower of Jesus your whole life.

551
00:40:36,360 --> 00:40:38,820
Or for a while, at least.

552
00:40:38,820 --> 00:40:40,480
You're probably like me.

553
00:40:41,240 --> 00:40:48,740
It's probably really easy for you to skim through Scripture, look at yourself in the mirror real quick, and believe.

554
00:40:52,040 --> 00:40:55,900
And don't be deceived into thinking that that's true spiritual flourishing.

555
00:40:55,900 --> 00:41:07,740
Because that's tiring and exhausting over time when you just keep doing this thing where you try and make yourself better in this area and in this area and in this area.

556
00:41:07,900 --> 00:41:18,940
When in reality, what we've been invited to is to allow the Word of God, not to make us think about how we can change our behavior, but to make us think about what it says about our hearts.

557
00:41:21,900 --> 00:41:29,940
To invest in our hearts, in our relationship with God, that we might learn to love God with all of our heart, soul, mind, and strength.

558
00:41:29,940 --> 00:41:31,760
And then love our neighbor as ourself.

559
00:41:31,760 --> 00:41:34,360
And this is a lifelong process that's done in relationship.

560
00:41:34,360 --> 00:41:39,360
And it's so much better than any moral modification that you might attempt.

561
00:41:39,720 --> 00:41:42,000
So don't be deceived, brothers, sisters.

562
00:41:42,000 --> 00:41:48,460
Let's receive and accept the invitation of Jesus.

563
00:41:48,460 --> 00:41:52,640
Not for moral behavior modification, but for spiritual flourishing.

564
00:41:52,640 --> 00:41:53,000
