00:42:27,780 --> 00:42:33,180
So, God, let us sit in front of the mirror, understand what's true about ourselves in light of you.

573
00:42:33,180 --> 00:42:40,020
Agree with what you say, like, agree that what you say is better.

574
00:42:40,020 --> 00:42:44,660
